OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe internet is full of fakery.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThere are news stories which are
OL,11,Fdeliberately distorted and blogs which
OL,12,Fhave a somewhat unusual relationship
OL,13,Fwith facts and reality.
OL,14,
OL,15,FPerhaps inevitably, there are some
OL,16,Fclips of old television which are not
OL,17,Fall that they may seem.
OL,18,
OL,19,FIt's important to make distinctions.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are some sincere attempts to
OL,7,Frecreate old presentation as accurately
OL,8,Fas possible.
OL,9,
OL,10,FFor instance, someone may have taken
OL,11,Foriginal audio and attempted to find
OL,12,Fappropriate pictures to go with it.
OL,13,
OL,14,FAnd there are also some loving, high
OL,15,Fquality recreations of old graphics and
OL,16,Fsequences.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12503
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is absolutely nothing wrong with
OL,7,Fthese as long as they are clearly
OL,8,Flabelled as mocks or recreations.
OL,9,FNobody is pretending they are 100pc
OL,10,Faccurate but they are usually made with
OL,11,Flove and represent a genuine and
OL,12,Finformed attempt to celebrate a bygone
OL,13,Fera.
OL,14,
OL,15,FThe problem is when material of
OL,16,Fquestionable quality is uploaded to
OL,17,FYouTube and other platforms.
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12504
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA researcher, say, or someone too young
OL,7,Fto remember the way things wereB may
OL,8,Fassume these uploads are still broadly
OL,9,Faccurate even when they realise they
OL,10,Fare mocks.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThere are a few things worth saying to
OL,13,Fhelp ensure people never fall into
OL,14,Ftraps.
OL,15,
OL,16,FFirstly, it is worth making an obvious
OL,17,Fpoint.
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12505
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUntil relatively recently, the
OL,7,Fprinciple skill of most announcers was
OL,8,Ftheir voice.
OL,9,
OL,10,FCalm authority, good diction, no speech
OL,11,Fimpediments and a pleasant tone were
OL,12,Fvital. Many had received formal drama
OL,13,For voice training. Network BBC
OL,14,Fannouncers rarely had noticeable
OL,15,Fregional accents.
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12506
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FPutting those who are not in possession
OL,7,Fof such attributes in front of a
OL,8,Fmicrophone in the name of diversity,
OL,9,Finclusion and authenticity is a modern
OL,10,Ftrend.
OL,11,
OL,12,FIf the voice on the video does not
OL,13,Fpossess these traditional qualities,
OL,14,Fyou should instantly suspect a mock or
OL,15,Ffake.
OL,16,
OL,17,FOne particular poster often uploads
OL,18,Fvideos which appear to show long
OL,19,Fintervals on ITV using BBC trade test
OL,20,Fand Ceefax music.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12507
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou cannot blame the layman for not
OL,7,Frecognising the music but there are a
OL,8,Ffew giveaways.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIt was very unusual for a commercial
OL,11,Fchannel to ever leave the screen blank
OL,12,Fvoluntarily between programmes after
OL,13,F1972. Before then daytime gaps were
OL,14,Fsometimes needed to comply with rules
OL,15,Fon broadcasting hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,FThere are only a few occasions in the
OL,18,F80s where you might have caught a
OL,19,Fcaption and music on ITV or Channel 4
OL,20,Fsuch as:
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12508
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FI don't want to condemn anyone posting
OL,7,Fthese mocks. They may be vulnerable.
OL,8,
OL,9,FHowever it is important to ensure that
OL,10,Fnobody comes to believe they are even
OL,11,Fremotely related to the television of
OL,12,Fthe era they claim to represent.
OL,13,
OL,14,FPersonally I'm surprised anyone who
OL,15,Fchances upon a video appearing to show
OL,16,Fa musical interval on ITV in the 80s `
OL,17,FvoicedB by someone who is clearly not a
OL,18,Fprofessional ` could fall for it.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12509
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second thing to do to avoid falling
OL,7,Ffor fakes is to check old schedules.
OL,8,
OL,9,FChannel 4 never routinely showed
OL,10,Fprogrammes displaced from ITV because
OL,11,Fof news, events or local industrial
OL,12,Fdisputes. CITV never moved to Ch 4 for
OL,13,Fthe day in the way BBC children's
OL,14,Fprogrammes hopped over to BBC Two.
OL,15,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12510
SC,0010
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1768740178
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                G10/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBeware the dodgy YouTube
OL,4,Ccontinuity mocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will be impossible, ultimately, to
OL,7,Fprevent unmarked fake videos being
OL,8,Fposted. In themselves they are harmless
OL,9,F` unlike some other internet fakes
OL,10,Fposted by those with dark political or
OL,11,Fsocial agendas.
OL,12,
OL,13,FBut those of us who are concerned with
OL,14,Fcelebrating TV's genuine history can do
OL,15,Fa lot to help ensure nobody falls for
OL,16,Fthem.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
